# PORT-VFX-MODULES (UE Niagara tick stages + Scene Depth collision): WallDust.dfx's BreakSparks carries
# Gravity -> Drag -> SolveForcesAndVelocity -> Collision (engine module, VFX_SceneDepthCollide). A stack calling a
# scene-reading host function ticks PostOpaque: its chain ("Particles PostOpaque: Open / Compact / Dispatch Args /
# Spawn+Update") runs on the graphics queue AFTER "Scene: DepthResolve" (SceneRenderer AddFrameParticlesPostOpaque)
# and reads this frame's resolved depth; the PreOpaque chain stays before the base pass on the async pipe. Its
# forward (additive) draws read the PostOpaque sort ("PostOpaque Particles: Sort ..."); G-buffer rows and Mesh
# instances of a PostOpaque emitter would draw the previous half (one frame lag, as UE). Camera as SLICE-02 /
# VFX-PORT-1.
# Step 5 (UE Niagara Event Handler, Spawned Particles): WallDust's ImpactPuffs states EventHandlers
# [{SourceEmitter BreakSparks, Event Collision, SpawnCount 2, InheritVelocity 0.1}] and has no spawn of its own (no
# EmitterUpdate row): each spark that moved INTO the scene in step s raises a Collision event (ParticleSimulate
# RaiseEvent), and step s+1 of ImpactPuffs spawns 2 dust puffs (0.45-0.75 s, 8-14 cm) at that point through
# engine:SpawnFromEvent (VFXStackCompiler appends it last in ParticleSpawn). UnifyEventTickStages puts ImpactPuffs
# in BreakSparks' PostOpaque chain. Step 6 (UE fx.Niagara.Debug): the live counts are read from `state vfx` (per
# live scene, system and emitter: alive / free of the last finished GPU copy, framesOld frames late; read back only
# while gpuCounts - Debug "Particles: Viewport overview" in Дано turns it on), the same numbers the overview draws.
# UNVERIFIED (written unbuilt). The scenario does not save the scene.
Дано run Scene "Open Scene SLICE-02.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Debug "Particles: Viewport overview"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position -800,190,-60
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.6,-0.17,0.78
Когда run Action Simulate
Когда advance 0.3
Когда run Action "Fire Field 'WallBlast'"
Когда 4 frames render
Когда state vfx
Тогда-вид port_vfx_modules_airborne the sparks are in the air, none has reached the floor yet; the overview (top right) lists WallDust's five emitters, BreakSparks alive > 0 and "ImpactPuffs: 0 / 2048" (no Collision event yet: the handler spawns nothing before a spark touches the scene)
Когда advance 0.6
Когда state vfx
Тогда-вид port_vfx_modules_puffs small dust puffs (8-14 cm, the dust colour of LandingDust, fading over ~0.6 s) sit at the points where sparks hit the floor in front of the broken wall, each next to a spark that lies / bounces there, none in mid-air where no spark touched anything; the overview lists "ImpactPuffs: N / 2048" with N > 0 (about 2 per spark impact)
Когда 120 frames render
Когда state views
Тогда-вид port_vfx_modules_sparks BreakSparks' sparks fell onto the floor in front of the broken wall and lie / bounce ON it (Restitution 0.3, Friction 0.4) - none falls through the floor; dust and smoke as VFX-PORT-1 walldust_modules
Тогда [log] editor.log: no "VUID", no [error] line from [Particles] (no "ImportCollisionInputs" refusal, no "sits out this frame", no "event handler" / "SpawnFromEvent" refusal from the reader or the stack compiler); the frame's graph has "Particles PostOpaque: Open" and "Particles PostOpaque: Spawn+Update 0" AFTER "Scene: DepthResolve" and "Particles PreOpaque: Open" before the base pass; ImpactPuffs' rows are in the PostOpaque chain (its alive count 0 in port_vfx_modules_airborne and > 0 in port_vfx_modules_puffs: puffs only after sparks hit the floor)
Тогда [log] the two `state vfx` replies (after the 4 frames, after advance 0.6): the active scene's entry has gpuCounts true and a system whose emitters are WallDust's BreakDust, BreakSmoke, BreakSparks, LandingDust, ImpactPuffs (capacity 2048 for ImpactPuffs), every one gpuRead true with framesOld a few frames (no stall); first reply: BreakSparks alive > 0, ImpactPuffs alive 0 and spawned 0 (no Collision event before a spark lands; spawned never counts event spawns); second reply: ImpactPuffs alive > 0 (puffs only after sparks hit the floor), BreakSparks alive > 0
Когда run Action Stop
